# Rust / native build output. `apps/desktop-tauri/src-tauri/target` reaches
# ~11.5 GB across ~15k files after a Tauri debug build, so leaving it
# unignored makes a plain `git add -A` attempt to commit the whole thing.
target/
**/target/
